<title>UK: Fog stops oil tankers berthing at Ventspils.</title>
<headline>Fog stops oil tankers berthing at Ventspils.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-06-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Oil tankers were prevented from berthing at the Latvian Baltic oil port of Ventspils on Tuesday due to foggy conditions, a shipping source said.</p>
<p>Two crude tankers which had been scheduled to load on Tuesday morning were waiting at anchor.</p>
<p>Three gas oil cargoes and a small jet cargo were already berthed, the source said.</p>
<p>--London Newsroom +44 171 542 5387</p>
